    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to No. 15 Millwood, Bunclody, a spacious and beautifully presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment extending to approximately 89.9 sq. m.\n\nSituated within the secure, gated Millwood development, the property is presented in excellent turnkey condition and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors or those seeking to downsize. The property also benefits from a floored attic with electricity and convenient access via a Stira folding attic stairs, providing valuable additional storage space. The annual management fee is approximately 1,300.\n\nBuilt circa 2004, the apartment enjoys a highly convenient location within easy walking distance of Bunclody town centre and its excellent selection of shops, cafés, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, excellent storage, a secure residential setting and a superb central location, No. 15 Millwood offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a ready-to-occupy home in the heart of Bunclody."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - 4.17m x 4.09m\nNeutrally decorated with solid wood flooring.\n\nOpen Plan Living/Kitchen: - 8.16m x 5.18m\nBright, dual-aspect space featuring shaker-style kitchen units, laminate worktops and a tiled splashback. The kitchen area has solid wood flooring, while the living area is carpeted and features an electric fire.\n\nBathroom: - 2.76m x 1.78m\nFully tiled and comprising a bath with electric shower, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1: - 3.71m x 4.78m\nSpacious master bedroom featuring built-in wardrobes, dual-aspect windows and carpeted flooring.\n\nEn-suite: - 1.87m x 1.78m\nFully tiled and comprising a shower, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2: - 4.15m x 5.05m\nCarpeted flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\n"
      },
      {
